<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρεί-φᾰτος</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρηΐφατος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνος,
		πέφαται</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slain by
				Ares,</i> i.e. <i>slain in war,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.31
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαί</span> [<i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				136
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνοι Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					603
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρειος</span>
			, <i>martial,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ. ἀγών, λῆμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				913
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				147
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					124
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>slaying in war,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					514
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
